{"id": "22-1225-2-2", "zh": "比丘等词群", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1226-2-9", "zh": "依“Gasīnaṃ”规则省略 si，得 bhikkhu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1226-10-15", "zh": "省略 yo 后元音变长，得 bhikkhū。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1227-2-3", "zh": "另一种情况是：", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1228-2-22", "zh": "177. Lā yonaṃ vo pume（阳性中，la 之后的 yo 变为 vo）［ka.119；rū.155；nī.294］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1229-2-11", "zh": "在阳性中，称为 la 的 u 类元音之后的 yo 可以变为 vo，这就是 yo 变 vo。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1230-2-21", "zh": "178. Vevosu lussa（在 ve、vo 之前，la 的 u 变为 ṭa）［ka.97；rū.156；nī.260］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1231-2-11", "zh": "在阳性中，后接 ve、vo 时，称为 la 的 u 音变为 ṭa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1232-2-3", "zh": "如 bhikkhavo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1233-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“la 的”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1233-5-6", "zh": "因为有 sayambhuvo 这样的形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1234-2-10", "zh": "Bho bhikkhu，bho bhikkhū，bhonto bhikkhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1235-2-20", "zh": "179. Pumālapane vevo（阳性呼格中变为 ve、vo）［ka.116；rū.157；nī.291］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1236-2-12", "zh": "在阳性呼格中，称为 la 的 u 音之后的 yo 可以变为 ve 或 vo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1237-2-49", "zh": "Bhonto bhikkhave；如“当时世尊召唤比丘们：‘比丘们！’”［ma.ni.1.1］，“诸天众已经来到，比丘们，你们要认识他们”［dī.ni.2.334］；bhikkhuṃ，bhikkhū，bhikkhavo，bhikkhunā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1237-50-87", "zh": "依“Sunaṃhisū”规则元音变长：bhikkhūhi，bhikkhūbhi，bhikkhussa，bhikkhuno，bhikkhūnaṃ，bhikkhusmā，bhikkhumhā，bhikkhunā，bhikkhūhi，bhikkhūbhi，bhikkhussa，bhikkhuno，bhikkhūnaṃ，bhikkhusmiṃ，bhikkhumhi，bhikkhūsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1238-2-33", "zh": "maṅku、maccu、ucchu、paṭu、bhāṇu、setu、ketu、sattu、sindhu、bandhu、kāru、neru、meru、ruru、veḷu 等词也照此变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1239-2-3", "zh": "下面说明特殊规定。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1240-2-24", "zh": "在 hetu、jantu、kuru 这几个词中，依“jantuhetu”等规则，yo 可以省略：hetu dhammo（因法），hetū dhammā（诸因法），atīte hetavo pañca（过去有五因）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1241-2-21", "zh": "180. Yomhi vā kvaci（在 yo 之前，有时可以……）［ka.97；rū.156；nī.260］。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1242-2-9", "zh": "在 yo 之前，称为 la 的 u 音有时可以变为 ṭa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1243-2-5", "zh": "如 atīte hetayo pañca（过去有五因）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1244-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1244-6-7", "zh": "因为也有 hetuyo 这样的形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1245-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1245-5-6", "zh": "因为也有 bhikkhavo 这样的形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1246-2-28", "zh": "Bho hetu，bho hetū，bhonto hetū，hetavo，hetayo，或 hetuyo；hetuṃ，hetū，hetavo，hetayo，或 hetuyo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1246-29-31", "zh": "其余与 bhikkhu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1247-2-11", "zh": "Jantu gacchati（众生走），jantū，jantayo，或 jantuyo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1248-2-28", "zh": "181. Jantādito no ca（jantu 等之后也变为 no）［ka.119；rū.155；nī.294；多数版本作‘jantvādito’］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1249-2-10", "zh": "在阳性中，jantu 等词之后的 yo 变为 no，也变为 vo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1250-2-32", "zh": "Jantuno，jantavo；bho jantu，bho jantū，bhonto jantū，jantayo，jantuyo，jantuno，jantavo；jantuṃ，jantū，jantayo，jantuyo，jantuno，jantavo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1250-33-35", "zh": "其余与 bhikkhu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1251-2-15", "zh": "Kuru，kurū，kurayo，kuruyo，kuruno，kuravo，全部与 jantu 相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1252-2-49", "zh": "可以见到这样的用例：“今天就让他把你带到俱卢人那里”［jā.2.22.1632］，“俱卢人见到你就欢喜”［jā.2.22.1641］，“我今天就把你带到俱卢人那里”［jā.2.22.1634］。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1253-2-50", "zh": "依大注规则，以 la 结尾的词，其 aṃ 格词尾有时也变为 naṃ，可以见到“kimatthinaṃ bhikkhunaṃ āhu，bhikkhunamāhu maggadesiṃ，bhikkhunamāhu maggajīviṃ，buddhaṃ ādiccabandhunaṃ”这样的用例；同样还有“roganiḍḍaṃ pabhaṅgunaṃ，bhogānañca pabhaṅgunaṃ［dha.pa.139］，viññāṇañca virāgunaṃ”。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-1253-51-90", "zh": "其中，‘kimatthinaṃ’意为具有什么本性的，‘maggadesiṃ’意为宣说道路的，‘maggajīviṃ’意为依道而活的，‘roganiḍḍaṃ’意为众病的巢穴，‘pabhaṅgunaṃ’意为本性易坏的，‘virāgunaṃ’意为本性离染的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1253-91-97", "zh": "有些地方也见到用作主格的情况，那里不加 n 增音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-1254-2-4", "zh": "比丘等词群到此结束。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1255-2-2", "zh": "导师等词群", "confidence": 80}
